<title>FINLAND: ENSO'S 2004 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 451 MLN.</title>
<headline>ENSO'S 2004 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 451 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postipankki on Wednesday</p>
<p>announced the following result of the second tranche of forest</p>
<p>industry group Enso Oy's 2004 bond:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Enso</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 6.00 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.26 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  98.568</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT:		     FIM 451 MLN</p>
<p> TOTAL AMOUNT OF BIDS:	     FIM 582 MLN</p>
<p>NOTES: After this auction the outstanding amount is 868 million</p>
<p>markka. The previous auction of the bond raised 417 million</p>
<p>markka at a price of 99.703 and a yield of 6.05 percent.</p>
<p>Enso has said the maximum amount to be auctioned is one</p>
<p>billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240, news@reuter.fi</p>
</text>
